          Rasakan sendiri kehangatan, keilmuan, dan kebersamaan yang tercipta
          di setiap sesi Happy Couple Class melalui video berikut.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="video-wrapper">
        <!-- YouTube Facade: fast, lightweight, zero initial iframe load -->
        <div
          class="video-facade"
          id="yt-facade"
          data-video-id="n2gCH72CH_8"
          role="region"
          aria-label="Pemutar video YouTube suasana kelas"
        >
          <img
            src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/n2gCH72CH_8/hqdefault.jpg"
            alt="Thumbnail Suasana Happy Couple Class bersama Kak Suhe"
            class="facade-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <button
            type="button"
            class="facade-play-btn"
            id="facade-play-btn"
            aria-label="Putar video suasana Happy Couple Class"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">play_arrow</span>
