            <span>Suasana Happy Couple Class bersama Kak Suhe</span>
          </span>
          <a
            href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n2gCH72CH_8"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="video-yt-link"
